		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>25-foot-tall suit of black plate mail filled with seething lava. General of Hell's army.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 18 (+3 plate mail), <strong>HP</strong> 105, <strong>ATK</strong> 4 +3 vorpal greataxe +10 (2d8 + behead), <strong>MV</strong> far (fly), <strong>S</strong> +6, <strong>D</strong> +5, <strong>C</strong> +6, <strong>I</strong> +5, <strong>W</strong> +5, <strong>Ch</strong> +6, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 22</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Behead</strong>. On a natural attack roll of 20, behead the target.</p><p></p><p><strong>Furnace</strong>. Creatures within near of Moloch at start of turn CON 15+ or 2d6 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Impervious</strong>. Fire immune. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Infernal Fortress</strong>. 1/day as an action, Moloch can cause a towering fortress to erupt from the ground.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
